Systematic Mapping Studies in
Software Engineering
Kai Petersen1;2, Robert Feldt1, Shahid Mujtaba1;2, Michael Mattsson1
1School of Engineering, Blekinge Institute of Technology, Box 520
SE-372 25 Ronneby
(kai.petersen jrobert.feldt jshahid.mujtaba jmichael.mattsson)@bth.se
